      <p class="eyebrow">The audit for AI-generated code</p>
      <h1 class="display">When your agent copy-pastes, <em>you see it first.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        CodeDedup is a Rust CLI that finds duplicated code across a repository and ranks the <strong>worst offenders at line one</strong>. Tree-sitter parsing. AST fingerprints. Semantic fusion. Fast enough to live in an agent's inner loop — not a nightly CI job.
      </p>
      <div class="install"><code>cargo install codededup</code></div>
    </div>

